        "These are descriptive historical relationships, expressed as realistic 25th-to-75th percentile contrasts and oriented so movement toward the conservative or traditional pole points right. They answer which positions accompanied overperformance. The explorer below separately shows cycle-and-demographic-adjusted estimates. Intervals crossing zero remain inconclusive.",
